# Test-leak guard: macOS tmpdir-style dirs that show up as `var-folders-*` or
# `private-var-folders-*` mean a test wrote into the repo cwd by mistake. The
# bug is fixed, but keeping this here so any future regression doesn't pollute
# the working tree silently.
var-folders-*/
private-var-folders-*/
